        'org_plan_frozen' => ['code' => 4025, 'status' => 402, 'meaning' => 'The organization\'s plan lapsed and its 30 day grace window has also passed, so no new organization funded upload is admitted. A job already running still settles normally. Paying a plan renewal clears the freeze right away.'],
