        'org_no_default_payment_method' => ['code' => 4029, 'status' => 409, 'meaning' => 'The chosen payment method is not one of the caller\'s own saved, fast checkout eligible cards, the caller has no Stripe customer at all, or auto renew was switched on with no renewal card stored yet. All three answer identically so this route can never be used to learn whether a given payment method id exists.'],
